1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Warehouse software was designed for humans clicking through screens,

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:14,000
not for AI agents operating safely with physical systems.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Physical AI WebMCP Command Center turns the web into an agent-native control layer.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:29,000
A compatible Agent discovers seven structured tools on this public HTTPS page.

5
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:34,000
One intent asks to move pallet P-104 to Rack A12.

6
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:39,000
The Agent observes warehouse state, source, and transport options.

7
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Every real planning stage is visible and timed:

8
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:49,000
pallet, destination, AGV, route, battery, safety, and selection.

9
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:54,000
The Agent selects AGV-03 and creates TP-001 - but cannot start it.

10
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Deterministic software validates the 41.6-meter route and battery reserve.

11
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:08,000
A human reviews the proposal and approves the high-impact action.

12
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:14,000
AGV-03 starts moving with P-104.

13
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:21,000
At N07, the active aisle becomes blocked.

14
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:28,000
The vehicle stops immediately. Mission M-001 enters BLOCKED.

15
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:34,000
The Agent reads changed mission state and invokes replan_mission.

16
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:41,000
Dijkstra removes the blocked edge and routes through N08 and N11.

17
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:48,000
The route changes visibly, and AGV-03 resumes.

18
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:54,000
P-104 reaches Rack A12. AGV-03 returns to idle.

19
00:01:54,000 --> 00:02:04,000
Mission complete. Tool names, results, and true latency remain visible.

20
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:09,000
The live benchmark compares the same endpoint.

21
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:15,000
Manual UI: seven measured interactions.

22
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:20,000
WebMCP: one intent plus one human approval.

23
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:25,000
Tool calls and runtime metrics are counted separately.

24
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:29,000
The Agent proposes. Deterministic software validates.

25
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:33,000
The human authorizes. Physical AI executes.

26
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:38,000
One web interface - for humans, agents, and physical machines.
